        "Relative Ratio: Drivers in the target group are 2.08 times more likely to accept the coupon compared to all other drivers.\n",
        "\n",
        "Conclusion: Combining frequent venue habits with age demographic filtering (older than 25) creates a strong predictor for coupon acceptance."
